{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12227090","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12227090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1222709001:1":{"text":"황금빛 자태, 우아한 몸놀림, 그리고 선명한 푸른색 꼬리... 게다가 이렇게 손쉽게 낚싯바늘에서 벗어나다니! 분명 전설 속의 골든 피콕이 맞을 거예요!","source_cn":"金黄的鱼影，婀娜的身姿，再加上尾巴那抹鲜亮的绿色，还能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72CAF8B29D721E40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1222709002:1":{"text":"상상한 것보다 훨씬 크고 화려해요... 이래서 러스트 항의 부자들이 그렇게 열광했나 봐요!","source_cn":"它比我想象的更巨大，也更华丽……难怪锈锚港的有钱人都对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE4684C59B3D5F65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222709003:1":{"text":"윽, 전혀 실망하는 눈치가 아니네요...","source_cn":"呃，你好像一点也不失望的样子呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x237A2AE4B04186FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222709004:1":{"text":"왜 실망해야 하죠? 골든 피콕이 나타났다는 것만으로도 제 방법이 틀리지 않았다는 거잖아요! 언젠가는 분명히 낚을 수 있을 거라고요!","source_cn":"为什么要失望？既然黄金孔雀出现了，那就说明我的方法没错...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A72DB7B624ED1C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222709005:1":{"text":"여러분, 만약 나중에 골든 피콕의 흔적을 발견하면 꼭 저에게도 알려주세요! 제 연구 보고서가 거기에 달려 있거든요!","source_cn":"几位，如果你们以后发现了黄金孔雀的踪迹，也记得告诉我一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D74C82FC15BCF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222709006:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 우리가 확실히 기억할게요!","source_cn":"放心吧，我们一定会记得的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185F429322451E26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:约克逊":{"text":"잭슨","source":"约克逊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}